1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,840
At a time when the Democratic Party is losing some support among Latinos, among black voters,

2
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:13,180
Nikki Haley, who, like you, is of Southeast Asian descent,

3
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:17,600
said this week that this country has never been a racist country.

4
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,600
So let me ask you directly.

5
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:24,700
Do you agree that America has never been a racist country?

6
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:31,740
You know, I, first of all, and I think everyone agrees, we all agree,

7
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:37,300
the issue of race in America is not something that should be the subject of a soundbite.

8
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:38,600
Right.

9
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:43,100
The history of racism in America should never be the subject of a soundbite

10
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:46,900
or a question that is meant to elicit a one-sentence answer.

11
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:53,240
But there is no denying that we have in our history as a nation

12
00:00:53,240 --> 00:01:01,380
racism and that racism has played a role in the history of our nation.

13
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:10,480
And when I think about it, I think we all would agree that while it is part of our past

14
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:17,240
and we see vestiges of it today, we should also be committed collectively

15
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:19,800
to not letting it define the future of our country.

16
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:25,120
But we cannot get to a place of progress on the issue of race

17
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:28,260
by denying the existence of racism.

18
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,800
By denying...

19
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:39,040
...

20
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,440
...

21
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,700
...

22
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:43,060
...

